content.text:
Now add `materialize` to engine and export. Also a helper to apply a semantic solution:
```js
function toAction(state, step) {
  if (step.card) {
    const hand = state.player.hand.findIndex(c => c.id === step.card);
    if (hand < 0) return null;
    return {type: step.type, hand, zone: step.zone, target: step.target};
  }
  return {type: step.type, zone: step.zone, target: step.target};
}
function applySolution(state, steps, puzzle) {
  for (const step of steps) {
    const action = toAction(state, step);
    if (!action || !isLegal(state, action)) return {ok:false, step, state, action};
    applyActionMut(state, action, puzzle);
    if (state.winner) break;
  }
  return {ok:true, state};
}
```
Add export.

Note: `activateSet` has zone, no card. Fine.
`endTurn` no params.

Also for `setSpell` the card id. Good.

